---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import pages from '../data/companies.json';

const title = 'Swedish Company Data API: harvest any SNI segment yourself';
const description = 'Search 9 verified Swedish company directories by SNI code, or run our allabolag.se scraper actor on the Apify Store for live data: org numbers, revenue, contacts. Pay per result.';

const actorUrl = 'https://apify.com/vhsgreed/allabolag-fresh-details';
const live = pages.pages ?? pages;
const sorted = [...live].sort((a, b) => b.count - a.count);
const total = pages.totalCompanies ?? live.reduce((s, p) => s + p.count, 0);
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <main>
    <h1>Swedish company data, harvested fresh</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The directories on this site are snapshots of the official Bolagsverket /
      SCB-sourced registry data via allabolag.se, harvested by our own scraper.
      Browse them free below, or run the scraper yourself when you need live
      data: pay per result, no subscription.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Browse free directories ({sorted.length} segments, {total} companies)</h2>
      <ul class="segments">
        {sorted.map((p) => (
          <li>
            <a href={`/companies/${p.slug}/`}>
              SNI {p.sni} {p.label}
            </a>
            <span class="count">{p.count} companies</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <p>
        More segments are harvested weekly. The directories update as new
        snapshots land.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="actor">
      <h2>Need live data or a segment we haven't harvested?</h2>
      <p>
        The same pipeline that builds these directories runs as a public actor
        on the Apify Store. Point it at any SNI code (all ~1,400 of them), a
        keyword, or a list of organization numbers, and get structured data:
        org number, SNI codes, county, addresses, phone, email, homepage,
        employees, revenue, profit, founding year, status, and board roles.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Search by SNI code or keyword, or batch up to 1,000 org numbers</li>
        <li>30+ fields per company, deduplicated by org number</li>
        <li>Structured dataset: CSV, Excel, JSON, or API</li>
        <li>Pay per result, start at $1.25 per 1,000 results</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="cta">
        <a href={actorUrl} rel="noopener">Run the Allabolag.se Scraper on the Apify Store</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How the data pipeline works</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <strong>Query:</strong> an SNI industry code (e.g. 43.210 for
          electrical installation), a free-text keyword, or explicit org
          numbers.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Harvest:</strong> the actor pages through allabolag.se
          listing results, then enriches each company from its registry detail
          page.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Deliver:</strong> one clean dataset item per company,
          deduplicated, ready for export or API use.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        The site directories are point-in-time snapshots of that pipeline's
        output. The actor is the live version.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede { max-width: 46rem; }
  .segments { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .segments li { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; align-items: baseline; padding: 0.25rem 0; }
  .segments a { font-weight: 600; }
  .count { color: #555; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .actor { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .cta a { font-weight: 700; }
  ol li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
</style>
